</div></div><div class="lp-block lp-section lp-section--name-grow lp-padding-bottom-6 lp-section-grow is-style-text-gray-100-background-gray-0" style="position:relative;z-index:9" data-section-name="grow"><div class="lp-section__content">
<div class="lp-block lp-content lp-content--text-alignment lp-content--text-alignment-left lp-wrapper lp-wrapper--layout-wide lp-flex@M " style="align-items:flex-end">
<div class="lp-block lp-content lp-margin-top-0 lp-margin-bottom-0@M" style="flex:1">
<div class="lp-block lp-content lp-content--text-alignment lp-content--text-alignment-left" style="max-width:441px">
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-text-align-left lp-margin-bottom-1 is-style-default text-wrap-pretty has-huge-font-size" id="your-forever-home-on-the-web">Your forever home on the web</h2>



<p class="has-text-align-left wp-block-paragraph">Grow your audience with WordPress.com and keep full ownership of your content and followers.</p>
</div>
</div>



<div class="lp-block lp-content lp-content--text-alignment lp-content--text-alignment-left">
<div class="lp-block lp-button lpc lpc-theme-all">
<div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://wordpress.com/setup/onboarding/?ref=logged-out-homepage-lp">Start publishing</a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>



<div class="lp-block lp-content lp-wrapper lp-wrapper--layout-wide lp-margin-top-5 lp-margin-top-1@M">
<div class="lp-block lp-content lp-margin-top-0  lp-grid lp-grid--section lp-grid--is-reverse@M lp-grid--is-reverse@L" style="--lp-grid-template-columns:7fr 5fr;align-items:center;column-gap:var(--lp-pad-3);row-gap:0">
<div class="lp-block lp-content">
<div class="lp-block lp-content lp-content-area--cycle lp-content-area--cycle-on-toggle">
<div class="lp-block lp-content" id="grow-your-newsletter">
<div class="lp-block lp-image"><div class="lp-image__content"><span class="lp-lazy-image" style="max-width:742px"><span class="lp-lazy-image__content" style="padding-top:calc(530/742*100%)"><img sizes="auto, (max-width: 742px) 100vw, 742px" srcset="https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/newsletters-1-1.webp?w=480 480w, https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/newsletters-1-1.webp?w=768 768w, https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/newsletters-1-1.webp?w=960 960w, https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/newsletters-1-1.webp?w=1152 1152w, https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/newsletters-1-1.webp?w=1487 1487w" src="https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/newsletters-1-1.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Woman sitting at a desk with a newsletter interface and growth chart overlay." width="742" height="530"></span></span></div></div>
</div>



<div class="lp-block lp-content" id="blogging-movement" style="pointer-events:none">
<div class="lp-block lp-image"><div class="lp-image__content"><span class="lp-lazy-image" style="max-width:742px"><span class="lp-lazy-image__content" style="padding-top:calc(530/742*100%)"><img sizes="auto, (max-width: 742px) 100vw, 742px" srcset="https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/blogging.webp?w=480 480w, https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/blogging.webp?w=768 768w, https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/blogging.webp?w=960 960w, https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/blogging.webp?w=1152 1152w, https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/blogging.webp?w=1487 1487w" src="https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/blogging.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Man sitting at his desk writing a blog post." width="742" height="530"></span></span></div></div>



<div class="lp-block lp-content" style="position:absolute;top:17%;width:100%;color:var(--studio-white)">
<p class="lp-blogging-text has-medium-landpack-font-size wp-block-paragraph">Hello |</p>
</div>
</div>



<div class="lp-block lp-content" id="great-content">
<div class="lp-block lp-image"><div class="lp-image__content"><span class="lp-lazy-image" style="max-width:742px"><span class="lp-lazy-image__content" style="padding-top:calc(530/742*100%)"><img sizes="auto, (max-width: 742px) 100vw, 742px" srcset="https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/discover-1.webp?w=480 480w, https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/discover-1.webp?w=768 768w, https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/discover-1.webp?w=960 960w, https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/discover-1.webp?w=1152 1152w, https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/discover-1.webp?w=1487 1487w" src="https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/discover-1.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Collage of WordPress.com website theme examples on a blue background." width="742" height="530"></span></span></div></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>



<div class="lp-block lp-content lp-padding-bottom-6@M">
<details data-event-name="grow-your-newsletter" class="lp-block lp-question lp-question--is-open lp-question--has-color color-gray-90 is-style-question-brand-line has-medium-landpack-font-size" open><summary><div class="lp-question__summary"><div class="lp-question__summary__marker" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="lp-question__summary__content">Grow your newsletter</div></div></summary><div class="lp-question__answer"><div class="lp-question__answer__content">
<div class="lp-block lp-content">
<p class="color-gray-40 wp-block-paragraph">Reach your audience on your terms. Share your story with rich customization, <a href="https://wordpress.com/newsletter/?ref=logged-out-homepage-lp">start free</a> with unlimited subscribers, and grow with pricing that lets you keep more of what you earn.</p>
</div>
</div></div></details>



<details data-event-name="blogging-movement" class="lp-block lp-question lp-question--has-color color-gray-90 is-style-question-brand-line has-medium-landpack-font-size"><summary><div class="lp-question__summary"><div class="lp-question__summary__marker" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="lp-question__summary__content">Join the blogging movement</div></div></summary><div class="lp-question__answer"><div class="lp-question__answer__content">
<div class="lp-block lp-content">
<p class="color-gray-40 wp-block-paragraph">Millions of creators are leaving social media stress behind. With WordPress.com blogs, your ideas have room to breathe, connect, and spark meaningful conversations.</p>
</div>
</div></div></details>



<details data-event-name="great-content" class="lp-block lp-question lp-question--has-color color-gray-90 is-style-question-brand-line has-medium-landpack-font-size"><summary><div class="lp-question__summary"><div class="lp-question__summary__marker" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="lp-question__summary__content">Discover great content</div></div></summary><div class="lp-question__answer"><div class="lp-question__answer__content">
<div class="lp-block lp-content">
<p class="color-gray-40 wp-block-paragraph">Explore WordPress.com’s creator network in the <a href="https://wordpress.com/reader?ref=logged-out-homepage-lp">Reader</a>. Discover handpicked posts with <a href="https://wordpress.com/freshly-pressed/?ref=logged-out-homepage-lp">Freshly Pressed</a>, from personal stories to expert insights, and find your next favorite read on the open web.</p>
</div>
</div></div></details>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div></div><div class="lp-block lp-section lp-section--name-vip is-style-gray-0" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(210, 210, 210, 1);overflow:hidden" data-section-name="vip"><div class="lp-section__content">
<div class="lp-block lp-content lp-wrapper lp-wrapper--layout-wide lp-grid lp-grid--section">
<div class="lp-block lp-content lp-content--text-alignment lp-content--text-alignment-left">
<div class="lp-block lp-image lp-image--align-left lp-margin-bottom-3"><div class="lp-image__content"><span class="lp-lazy-image" style="max-width:74px"><span class="lp-lazy-image__content" style="padding-top:calc(32/74*100%)"><img sizes="auto, (max-width: 74px) 100vw, 74px" srcset="https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/vip-logo-2.webp?w=152 152w" src="https://wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/vip-logo-2.webp" loading="lazy" alt="WordPress VIP logo" width="74" height="32"></span></span></div></div>



<h2 id="think-wordpress-isn-t-for-the-enterprise-think-again" class="wp-block-heading has-large-font-size">Think WordPress isn’t for the enterprise? Think again.</h2>



<p class="lp-width-480 wp-block-paragraph">What do Salesforce, Al Jazeera, Capgemini, and Facebook have in common?</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">They trust WordPress VIP—the enterprise platform built on WordPress—to deliver performance at scale while meeting the highest security standards. Starting at $25,000/year.</p>



<div class="lp-block lp-button lpc lpc-cta-vip">
<div class="wp-block-button is-style-wide"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://wpvip.com/wordpress-vip-agile-content-platform?utm_source=WordPresscom&amp;utm_medium=automattic_referral&amp;utm_campaign=lohp">Get a demo</a></div>
</div>
</div>


